  "solution": "The logic followed here is :-\n\n**Sum of 1st, 2nd and third number is 80.**\n\n{25, 19, 36} → 25 + 19 + 36 = 80\n\nSimilarly,\n\n1) {9, 49, 16} → 9 + 49 + 16 = 74\n\n**2) {20, 28, 32} → 20 + 28 + 32 = 80**\n\n3) {30, 25, 35} → 30 + 25 + 35 = 90\n\n4) {36, 23, 48} → 36 + 23 + 48 = 107\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"{20, 28, 32}\".**",
